      "zh": "区分背侧目标导向和腹侧刺激驱动注意网络，支持额顶区域的系统级解释。",
      "en": "The review distinguishes goal-directed and stimulus-driven attention systems, including their relevance to neglect. Network findings should not be assigned to an entire parietal gyrus."
