    "resultSummaries": {
      "zh": "将 MEG 的时间信息与 fMRI 的空间表征联系，显示视觉物体信息随加工阶段变化；不是直接把 MEG 传感器当作皮层坐标。",
      "en": "MEG decoding and fMRI representational similarity linked the timing and location of object information: earlier MEG representations corresponded more strongly to early visual cortex, and later representations to inferior temporal cortex."
    },
