    "resultSummaries": {
      "zh": "在两只猕猴 fMRI 定位的面孔斑块内，绝大多数有视觉反应的记录细胞具有面孔选择性；不能把猕猴斑块直接当成人类 DK 梭状回。",
      "en": "fMRI-guided recordings in two macaques found that almost all visually responsive cells sampled in the targeted face patch were face selective. The monkey patch is not a human DK fusiform label."
    },
