      "zh": "Greeble 训练后，面孔偏好区域对受训练物体的活动增强，支持经验可塑性；研究未证明这些区域对面孔没有选择性。",
      "en": "Training with novel Greeble objects increased responses in face-preferring fusiform regions under the tested matching conditions. This supports experience-dependent recruitment without eliminating face selectivity."
